===Etymology===
{{bor+|sv|ru|-}} (as evidenced by the spelling of the word reflecting the {{transliteration|sv|ru|Азербайджан|nocap=1}}; the Russian <ж> (<ž>) is transliterated as <zj> in Swedish). Ultimately from {{der|sv|grc|Ἀτροπατηνή}}. See {{m+|en|Azerbaijan}} for more. 

